WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.995
In this second fictional drill, Ember has locked Alistar.

2
00:00:06.015 --> 00:00:09.722
Tide replies with Rell and Poppy in one consecutive turn.

3
00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:16.231
Glow can play Poppy, but the reply consumes it: two future support slots now share only Braum.

4
00:00:16.251 --> 00:00:19.803
So adding a champion to the pool still leaves a shortage.

5
00:00:19.823 --> 00:00:26.396
If the coach has approved Thresh for Glow instead, those same three locks fill all 30 remaining slots.

6
00:00:26.416 --> 00:00:32.312
Compare approved pool options against the actual reply, then save the preparation for your next game.

